@startuml UC-08-Mengikuti-Kuis
title Sequence Diagram: Mengikuti Kuis

actor "Users (Learner)" as User
participant "Halaman Kuis\ndengan Timer\n(React)" as UI
participant "GET /api/kuis/:id\nPOST /api/kuis/:id/submit" as API
participant "KuisController" as Controller
participant "KuisService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL\n(tabel Kuis, Soal,\nKunciJawaban,\nRiwayatBelajar,\nPengguna)" as DB

== Fase 1: Memulai Kuis ==

User -> UI: Memilih kuis dari daftar
activate UI
UI -> API: GET /api/kuis/:id
activate API
API -> Controller: getKuisInfo(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getKuisDetail(id)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Kuis\nWHERE idKuis = '[id]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return info kuis\n(judul, jumlah soal,\nbatas waktu, poin)
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: {...} }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data info kuis
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> User: Menampilkan info kuis
User -> UI: Klik "Mulai Kuis"
UI -> API: GET /api/kuis/:id/soal
activate API
API -> Controller: getSoal(id)
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: getSoalKuis(id)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM Soal\nWHERE idKuis = '[id]'\nORDER BY urutan
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return array soal\n(tanpa kunci jawaban)
deactivate DB
Service --> Controller: { success: true, data: [...soal] }
Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
API --> UI: Data soal
deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
UI --> User: Menampilkan soal pertama
UI -> UI: Memulai timer countdown\n(misal: 30 menit)

== Fase 2: Mengerjakan Kuis ==

loop Untuk setiap soal
    User -> UI: Membaca soal dan\nmemilih jawaban (A/B/C/D)
    UI -> UI: Menyimpan jawaban ke\nstate local/temporary
    User -> UI: Klik "Soal Berikutnya"
    UI -> UI: Update nomor soal,\ntampilkan soal berikutnya
end

== Fase 3: Submit Jawaban ==

User -> UI: Setelah semua soal,\nklik "Kumpulkan Jawaban"
UI -> API: POST /api/kuis/:id/submit\n{ idPengguna, idKuis, jawaban:\n[{idSoal, jawabanDipilih},...],\nwaktuPengerjaan }
activate API
API -> Controller: submitKuis()
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: evaluateKuis(data)
activate Service
Service -> DB: SELECT * FROM KunciJawaban\nWHERE idKuis = '[id]'
activate DB
DB --> Service: Return array kunci jawaban
deactivate DB

alt Kunci jawaban ditemukan
    Service -> Service: Loop & cocokkan\njawaban dengan kunci
    Service -> Service: Hitung jumlah\njawaban benar
    Service -> Service: Kalkulasi skor\n(benar/total × 100)
    Service -> Service: Kalkulasi XP Learner\n(berdasarkan skor,\nmisal: 80% = 40 XP)
    Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    activate DB
    Service -> DB: INSERT INTO RiwayatBelajar\n(idPengguna, idKonten,\ntipeKonten, xpDidapat, skor,\ntanggalSelesai)\nVALUES ('[userId]', '[kuisId]',\n'kuis', 40, 80, NOW())
    DB --> Service: INSERT success
    Service -> DB: UPDATE Pengguna SET\nxpLearner = xpLearner + 40,\ntotalXP = totalXP + 40\nWHERE idAkun = '[userId]'
    DB --> Service: User XP updated
    Service -> Service: Cek threshold rank
    Service -> DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
    DB --> Service: Transaction committed
    deactivate DB
    Service --> Controller: { success: true,\nskor: 80, benar: 8,\ntotal: 10, xpGained: 40,\ndetailJawaban: [...] }
    Controller --> API: Response 200 OK
    API --> UI: Hasil evaluasi
    UI --> User: Menampilkan halaman hasil\n(skor, jawaban benar/salah,\nXP yang didapat)
    UI --> User: Tampilkan detail per soal
else Kunci jawaban tidak ditemukan
    Service --> Controller: { success: false,\nerror: "Kunci jawaban\ntidak ditemukan" }
    Controller --> API: Response 500
    API --> UI: Error response
    UI --> User: Tampilkan error\n"Hubungi admin"
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate API
deactivate UI

== Alternate: Waktu Habis ==

note over UI
  Jika timer mencapai 00:00:
  - UI auto-disable semua input
  - Auto-submit dengan jawaban
    yang sudah diisi
  - Soal belum dijawab = salah
end note

== Alternate: Review Jawaban ==

note over User, UI
  Sebelum submit, user bisa
  klik "Review Jawaban" untuk
  melihat ringkasan dan mengubah
  jawaban jika perlu
end note

@enduml
